{"summary":"Your kids will love Kids Learn to Sort, our latest preschool curriculum app.","description":"Your kids will love Kids Learn to Sort, Intellijoy's latest preschool curriculum app.  Thrilling your kids as they learn preschool fundamentals, Intellijoy's apps are clean and intuitive. Your children will love playing its numerous activities all on their own - without any assistance.  With the help of Sorty the Cute Monster, your child will learn to sort by:\n- shape \n- size \n- color\n- numerical count \n- spatial direction\n- occupation\n- household area\n- clothing type \n- and animal habitat\nThe lite version has 5 activities, while the full version has 35 activities with increasing level of challenge.","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9Pclfwe7Wr4?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/iROfCypj6EE_Ig5OPd9dOM0p5EreaDXIfOTyKBe_ISaaGmsH_mkYxtUq3W2K76Rddnl262XAkLcBwHpk041W","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4oQOkDxCYBF5csbtccFcUm6Stu-CVQ6RccQrdLdTOtk2U4Tu57_WQ3vB8byBAUtqNirLOvSGv0R0be3iQzuLLbk","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QtAeF0EeCIF5y_4lzQUW64GqVHnLVaTx_fDRJo31vOt3P9k2W8ws6bqWHDF3iGV_QX3gumabQVe72XYvci3o1rI","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/XMc_31_8bcd7Ky8GKgqxgor2xFVXASbr9zY0BvXMkOLmtH9X4Y_OZgiQu11JuPqV8YE0teKWJtQe0qLdsm9pXw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/nkoniM3zKygPHAuUc1vaq7uOQ2bPUiKLJUFO46pb--3I9PasrnsG8eo0YqHUT9Fm0eMt1W6Wi8lCBsax6TY9","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/A-Lv2LUmuoj5Jo2na4qLaiLzINXYu1QLQRBd7jPL4OcStiTxprVZf29NnHd3QN6Asn-9DcJMoqnxLBfwqzs0eS4","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4oQOkDxCYBF5csbtccFcUm6Stu-CVQ6RccQrdLdTOtk2U4Tu57_WQ3vB8byBAUtqNirLOvSGv0R0be3iQzuLLbk","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QtAeF0EeCIF5y_4lzQUW64GqVHnLVaTx_fDRJo31vOt3P9k2W8ws6bqWHDF3iGV_QX3gumabQVe72XYvci3o1rI","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/XMc_31_8bcd7Ky8GKgqxgor2xFVXASbr9zY0BvXMkOLmtH9X4Y_OZgiQu